OL,6,
OL,7,FFreddie is autistic, non-verbal and has
OL,8,Fan eating disorder called pica, which
OL,9,Fmeans he will eat non-food objects. He
OL,10,Fcould also run away if not monitored by
OL,11,Fan adult.
